00:58:49.320 --> 00:58:56.120
through the waist and the hamstring on this side come top slowly place your

00:58:56.120 --> 00:58:59.970
hand on the floor press yourself up into your knee and extend the left

00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:06.840
arm way up and over. Long stretch here. Really feel the stretch through the waist. Turn

00:59:06.840 --> 00:59:11.850
and face the sides. Place this hand on the floor. Take the bent knee and put it in the

00:59:11.850 --> 00:59:17.790
ten o'clock position. Lower the back leg down to the floor. Beginners, you'll stay

00:59:17.790 --> 00:59:24.060
here. All others, lower the forearms down and then the chest. You'll feel the stretch

00:59:24.060 --> 00:59:28.680
through the hip. Press top slowly.

00:59:30.190 --> 00:59:35.900
reach for the foot pull your heel towards your glute feel the stretch to

00:59:35.900 --> 00:59:42.760
the front of the leg your quadricep muscles extend the leg roll into the

00:59:42.760 --> 00:59:48.330
table position you're on both hands and both knees take a deep breath in and

00:59:48.330 --> 00:59:52.520
round the back up towards the ceiling drop your chin towards your chest separate

00:59:52.520 --> 00:59:58.350
your shoulders pervert your stretch your navel goes towards the floor cast your

00:59:58.350 --> 00:59:59.450
eyes and chin up

01:00:00.440 --> 01:00:08.190
feels wonderful come back neutral place your toes to the mat walk your hands back

01:00:08.190 --> 01:00:13.410
towards your knees and press your weight up into your feet walk it back until it

01:00:13.410 --> 01:00:19.300
is in your heels keeping your knees bent place one hand above each knee roll up

01:00:19.300 --> 01:00:27.040
slowly your head is last to come up face the front take the right arm up and over

01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:36.100
pull your head to the shoulder gently. To intensify, press away with the opposite hand.

01:00:36.390 --> 01:00:43.480
You'll feel the stretch to the side of your neck. Bring your head center, take the other arm off and over.

01:00:44.840 --> 01:00:52.200
Long lateral stretch here. As you come up, gently pull your head to your shoulder and press away with the hand

01:00:52.200 --> 01:00:59.880
to intensify. You'll feel this stretch in the other side of the neck. Bring your head top, take a deep breath in.

01:01:00.800 --> 01:01:10.500
Both arms come up. Exhale down. Way to go. You did it. You've just finished Firm Complete Aerobic and Weight Training.

01:01:11.460 --> 01:01:15.760
Congratulations on making a commitment to fitness and being a happier, healthier you.

01:01:16.150 --> 01:01:19.710
Before you know it, you'll be on your way to achieving the results that you want.

01:01:20.340 --> 01:01:23.120
Thanks for working out with us, and we hope to see you again soon.

01:01:23.540 --> 01:01:27.100
In the meantime, keep working hard. Your body will love you for it.
